OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather grey start with some
OL,6,Fspots of rain or drizzle. Skies
OL,7,Fbrightening up towards lunchtime with
OL,8,Fsome sunny spells developing by the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Feeling a little cooler
OL,10,Fthan Sunday but still pleasant in the
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry initially but a band of
OL,14,Frain will quickly move in throughout
OL,15,Fthe evening. The rain will turn heavy
OL,16,Fand persistent at times, giving a wet
OL,17,Fnight across the region.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
