OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FRain will clear east during
OL,6,Fthe morning, with brighter skies
OL,7,Fdeveloping by lunchtime. A few showers
OL,8,Fpossible during the afternoon, but
OL,9,Fmany areas will be dry and bright.
OL,10,FFeeling cooler.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDrier
OL,13,Fand brighter on Wednesday with spells
OL,14,Fof sunshine. Another band of rain then
OL,15,Fmoves in for Thursday, before drier
OL,16,Fand brighter weather returns on
OL,17,FFriday. Temperatures likely around
OL,18,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
